Text fontSize="20" color="#18212E" fontFamily="Inter">960 / 8,000</Text></Align></Container><Container width="130" height="30"><Align alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#18212E" fontFamily="Inter">12.00%</Text></Align></Container></Row></Positioned></Stack></Column></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="40" top="820" width="1520" height="150"><Container width="1520" height="150" color="#1F2937" borderRadius="14" padding="(18,26)"><Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Container width="6" height="110" color="#F59E0B" borderRadius="3" /><SizedBox width="18" /><Container width="850"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontSize="17" color="#FCD34D" fontStyle="BOLD" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="2">主结论</Text><SizedBox height="2" /><Text fontSize="22" color="#F8FAFC" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.32">两渠道转化率均上升（直接 +5.0pp、推广 +2.0pp），总体却从 26.0% 降到 16.6%：访问构成由“直接 80%”翻转为“推广 80%”，低转化渠道占比上升，按成交/访问加权的总体率随之被拉低。</Text></Column></Container><SizedBox width="24" /><Container width="1" height="100" color="#475569" /><SizedBox width="24" /><Container width="520"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontSize="17" color="#FDBA74" fontStyle="BOLD" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="1">不能证明因果</Text><SizedBox height="2" /><Text fontSize="18" color="#CBD5E1" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.32">两期观察数据，无随机化或对照；季节、投放质量、统计口径等混杂因素均可能影响结果，不能推断单向因果。</Text></Column></Container></Row></Container></Positioned></Stack>
</Snapshot>
